<title>USA: USDA offers 18-month export credit terms to Brazil.</title>
<headline>USDA offers 18-month export credit terms to Brazil.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Monday it amended its offer of export credit guarantees to Brazil to include coverage of 18-month credit terms on sales made in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>USDA has offered $150 million in short-term credits to facilitate sales of agricultural products to Brazil.</p>
<p>So far, $75 million of the credits have been released and $75 million were held by USDA for later release.</p>
</text>
